# R Code Style

Follow the [tidyverse style guide](https://style.tidyverse.org) for all R code.

- Use tidyverse idioms (`dplyr`, `tidyr`, `purrr`, `ggplot2`, `readr`, `tibble`).
- Native pipe `|>` (not `%>%`); assignment with `<-`.
- 2-space indent; max line width 80; `snake_case` names.
- Format with `styler` (tidyverse transformers) before committing.
- Do not change behavior when restyling — formatting only.

See also: `.github/instructions/r-style.instructions.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
